{"id":"popular","lemma":"popular","pos":"adj","rank":1722,"glosses":["popular","Pertaining to PP (Partido Popular), a Spanish political party"],"ipa":"/popuˈlaɾ/","forms":{"femininePlural":"populares"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/88/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-popular.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tom es muy popular.","en":"Tom is very popular.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/798887"},{"text":"Me gustan los cantos populares.","en":"I like folk songs.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443864"},{"text":"Tom es bastante popular.","en":"Tom is quite popular.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/162695"},{"text":"Le gusta cantar canciones populares.","en":"He likes to sing popular songs.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/645229"},{"text":"¿A que Tom es popular?","en":"Tom is really popular, isn't he?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/801371"}]}